00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:29.620
It is very close to the same
price as GCS Coldline, which

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:32.200
offers millisecond access time.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:34.690
We also offer Nearline,
Regional, and GCS

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:35.830
multi-regional.

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:39.324
The reason we've put their
storage options next to ours

00:18:39.324 --> 00:18:40.990
is what you'll notice
is ours are always

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:43.480
below theirs,
which means that we

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:46.900
