00:24:45.440 --> 00:24:47.780
but also for a lot
of other reasons.

00:24:47.780 --> 00:24:49.822
On the left, we offer you
a true cloud economics.

00:24:49.822 --> 00:24:51.030
That's all about the pricing.

00:24:51.030 --> 00:24:52.970
And we've walked through
a number of examples

00:24:52.970 --> 00:24:55.760
where we provide you
very transparent,

00:24:55.760 --> 00:24:58.280
friendly pricing
structures that you can--

00:24:58.280 --> 00:24:59.840
without taking a lot of time--

00:24:59.840 --> 00:25:00.980
take advantage of.

00:25:00.980 --> 00:25:03.365
Most of these you
take advantage of just

00:25:03.365 --> 00:25:04.490
by using the system at all.

00:25:04.490 --> 00:25:06.920
You don't have to plan ahead.

00:25:06.920 --> 00:25:08.881
We offer you future-proof
infrastructure,

00:25:08.881 --> 00:25:10.630
where you can scale
your business smoothly

00:25:10.630 --> 00:25:11.524
