00:25:15.269 --> 00:25:16.810
And you didn't have
to plan for that.

00:25:16.810 --> 00:25:19.480
You didn't have to buy
them a couple of years ago.

00:25:19.480 --> 00:25:21.800
You can buy them the
second that you want them.

00:25:21.800 --> 00:25:24.010
And then, the second you
stop wanting to use them,

00:25:24.010 --> 00:25:25.690
you can stop paying for them--

00:25:25.690 --> 00:25:28.200
big advantages that you
get from using the cloud.

00:25:31.170 --> 00:25:33.950
You can also get access
to incredible innovation.

00:25:33.950 --> 00:25:36.230
Google is known for our
artificial intelligence

00:25:36.230 --> 00:25:37.380
